132	## Flow Sharing Patterns
133	
134	### StateFlow for UI State
135	
136	```kotlin
137	// commonMain/kotlin/coroutines/StateFlowExtensions.kt
138	fun <T> StateFlow<T>.shareIn(
139	    scope: CoroutineScope,
140	    started: SharingStarted = SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000),
141	    replay: Int = 1
142	): StateFlow<T> {
143	    return this
144	}
145	
146	// Multiplatform caching
147	fun <T> Flow<T>.cachedIn(
148	    scope: CoroutineScope
149	): Flow<T> = cached(scope)
150	```
